message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and also cite the CMB-LCA dataset."
type: software
title: "Lung Cancer Imaging Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Lung cancer CT analysis on the TCIA CMB-LCA collection: patient-matched cohort analysis,
  lesion detection, severity grading, abnormality classification and annotated image output.
  Research use only; not for clinical diagnosis.
authors:
